! Proposed Definitions And Examples

!! cmavo: fa (FA)

!!! Proposed Definition
1st sumti place -- sumti place tag: tag 1st sumti place

!!! See Also
* {fe}
* {fi}
* {fo}
* {fu}
* {BAI}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* 1st sumti place

!!! Usage Examples
* i crane abu fa lo drata ke clani vorme

!!! Notes
See the notes section at the bottom of this document.

